# LeakSanitizer suppressions for verification runs on an ASAN engine
# (SPRING_ENGINE_BIN / SPRING_HEADLESS_BIN pointed at one). Keep this narrow:
# only process-lifetime allocations in third-party libraries the engine cannot
# free. A leak whose stack reaches engine or game code must still fail.

# The proprietary NVIDIA driver's allocations while the gpu renderer brings up
# OpenGL.
leak:libnvidia-glcore.so

# NVIDIA registers with the session bus during driver initialization; there is
# no teardown API for it.
leak:dbus_bus_register
